  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture on the Mac, with the LOT-001 (#38) kit (`tooling/fixtures/`), the page state: attributes of the doubled `md_user` / `md_passs` `Set-Cookie` on logged-in pages (`R55-p1`, `R03` metas list each name twice): domain, path, expiry, any `deleted` value\n\n### Scope\n\nState to capture: attributes of the doubled `md_user` / `md_passs` `Set-Cookie` on logged-in pages (`R55-p1`, `R03` metas list each name twice): domain, path, expiry, any `deleted` value\n\nNote: metas keep cookie names only; a `deleted` half would make every session refresh `identityNotConfirmed` and fail every login.\n\nRules: anonymize every free-text field; cookie values never leave the raw capture (record names and attributes only); never hand-build the state in the cloud (LESSONS 36); add a legacy oracle when a parser consumes it (LOT-002 (#39)..005 tooling); one PR per batch of captures.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-044 (#70), LOT-043 (#69)\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Owner / session\n\n— (ready; `host: mac`)\n\n### Source\n\nPending capture of [LOT-044 spec](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-044-session-health.md) (PR #29).",
