   "body": "### Capture result\nCorpus: `R74` (meta note), PR #386 (`capture/session-expiry`).\nEach logged-in page (home, followed list, profile page 1) sets `md_user` and `md_passs` twice. First comes the value with `expires` +30 days, `path=/`, `domain=.hardware.fr`. Then comes `deleted` with `expires=Thu, 01-Jan-1970 00:00:01 GMT`, `path=/`, `domain=.forum.hardware.fr`, which removes host-scoped leftovers. The login answer (`W03`) sets each name once.\nChanges: LOT-044 (the pair must not end a refresh as `identityNotConfirmed`). Test asked in #383.",
